# Golden prompt snapshots are compared byte-for-byte against generated
# prompts (rust/crates/claw-multiagent/tests/prompt_goldens.rs). Force LF so
# Windows checkouts (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true) do not
# turn them into CRLF and fail the comparison with an invisible diff.
rust/crates/claw-multiagent/tests/goldens/*.txt text eol=lf
